<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Get Started - Task Manager</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="getStarted.css">
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">

        <h1>Welcome to Task Manager</h1>
        <p>
            Manage your daily tasks efficiently and stay productive.
            Choose an option below to get started.
        </p>

        <div class="cards">

            <div class="card">
                <h2>Create Task</h2>
                <p>Add a new task to your list.</p>
                <a href="#">Create</a>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h2>View Tasks</h2>
                <p>See all your pending and completed tasks.</p>
                <a href="#">View</a>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h2>Login</h2>
                <p>Access your personal task dashboard.</p>
                <a href="#">Login</a>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h2>Register</h2>
                <p>Create a new account and start organizing.</p>
                <a href="#">Register</a>
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>